## M17 — Images & pixel canvas  ·  CHECK FIRST  ·  effort: unknown

A "pixel" in a terminal canvas is an emitted glyph plus colour codes — the same source ≠ rendered gap,
in the module where it is most concrete. **This may already be covered by the existing density
material. Read `M17-images-canvas.html` before writing anything.** Listed so it is not forgotten, not
because a gap has been confirmed.

